[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_II]
High Rank Crystal Staff (Witchcraft)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_II_desc]
The high-rank crystal staff, forged from the rarest and most precious crystals in all of Equestria, is a symbol of authority and power. Its gleaming surface reflects the light like a thousand disco balls, dazzling both friend and foe alike. With this staff in hoof, you’ll be able to command the very forces of chaos and harmony, or at the very least, feel really important. Because let’s face it, waving this overly fancy stick around won’t help you much if you can’t tell the difference between a spell and a sandwich.
§g“To be fair, it does hurt badly if you take a hit on the head with it. Afterall it has a solid crystal top.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_II_short]
High Rank Crystal Staff

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_II]
高阶水晶法杖 (巫术装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_II_desc]
高阶水晶法杖由全小马国最稀有、最珍贵的水晶锻造而成，是权威和权力的象征。它闪闪发光的表面像一千个迪斯科球一样反射着光线，让朋友和地方都眼花缭乱。有了这根法杖，你将能够指挥混沌与谐律的力量，或者至少，感觉自己真的很重要。让我们面对现实吧，如果你无法说出咒语和一块三明治的区别，那么挥舞这根过度华丽的棍子对你其实没有多大帮助。
§g“公平地说，如果你被它击中头部，确实会很疼的。毕竟它的顶端是一块实心的水晶。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_II_short]
高阶水晶法杖
